# tree16_nonblocking_100Gbps.topo
# Diagnostic scale-out fabric: all 16 hosts on ONE non-blocking switch (Podsize==
# Nodes==Radix_Down => 1 ToR, every pair one hop, no oversubscription). Same 100
# Gbps per-host link as tree16.topo, but removes the 4-ToR / 2:1-oversubscribed
# structure — used to isolate whether TP4-vs-TP2 differences come from the tree's
# oversubscription + DP-ring locality rather than raw bandwidth.
Nodes 16
Tiers 2
Podsize 16

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 16
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 1
Switch_Latency_ns 0
Oversubscribed 16

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 1
Switch_Latency_ns 0
